        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a proprietary 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system: heavy‑duty 80‑GSM bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for glass, temple idols and delicate décor. Each layer is applied by trained technicians, and items are secured with ratchet lashings inside our GPS‑tracked containers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport my two‑wheeler or car along with household goods from Garga Bridge?</h3>
