      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Garga Bridge to Mumbai relocation take, and what factors influence the timeline?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit averages 3‑4 days on the NH 19 Grand Trunk Road corridor, assuming normal traffic and weather conditions. Factors that can affect timing include roadwork, extreme weather, customs clearance for any cross‑state permits, and the volume of goods. Our 4‑protocol zero‑damage system includes a pre‑move audit to provide a realistic schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for a smooth relocation from Garga Bridge, and how does Shree Ashirwad assist?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, address proof, GSTIN (if applicable), and a signed moving contract. For corporate or government moves, additional e‑Way bills and reimbursement forms may be required. Our dedicated support team prepares all paperwork, verifies compliance with IBA standards, and ensures the documents are ready for submission before loading.</p>
