      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for moving household goods from Garga Bridge, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend the 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. It covers loss, theft, or damage to any item during loading, transit, or unloading, up to the full declared value. The policy is included in the final quote, and we handle all claim procedures on your behalf for a hassle‑free experience.</p>
